; Gravekeeper UI theme (docs/VERTICAL_SLICE_DESIGN.md §7, owner W2).
; Look: ink-blue backgrounds (#1F2A3A), dark-wood frames and buttons, aged-parchment
; text and cards, candle-amber accent (#F2A93B), stone grey (#8A8F94) for secondary text,
; dried red (#8C2F2B) only for warnings. Subtle borders, 4-6 px corners, no neon.
; Sizes are authored for the 1920x1080 base viewport (stretch mode canvas_items).
; FONT: PLACEHOLDER – no default_font is set, so Godot's built-in default font is used
; until a final font is chosen (then set default_font here and nowhere else).
; Type variations used by the code: HeaderLabel, SubheaderLabel, TitleLabel, DimLabel,
; AccentLabel, WarningLabel, GoodLabel, InkLabel, InkDimLabel, InkHeaderLabel, HudLabel,
; HudClockLabel, HudDimLabel, PromptLabel, KeyLabel, CountLabel, WindowPanel, HudPanel,
; CardPanel, SectionPanel, SlotPanel, KeyCapPanel, DimPanel, DebugPanel, NoteInfo,
; NoteReward, NoteWarning, AccentButton, DangerButton, ChoiceButton, CloseButton,
; FreshBar, WiltedBar, DecayBar, DayIcon (colours for the sun/moon icon), SlotButton (chest
; slots), grave register book: LedgerPanel (leather cover), LedgerPagePanel (parchment page),
; LedgerHeadPanel, LedgerRowPanel (ruled lines), LedgerTitleLabel, LedgerHeadLabel,
; LedgerWarnLabel, LedgerCloseButton, LedgerScrollBar, LedgerOrnament (ink/rule/margin colours).
; Phase 3: BuildSlotButton / BuildSlotSelected (build bar, amber frame = selected),
; ReputationMeter (track/fill/tick/frame colours of the 0–100 reputation bar).
[gd_resource type="Theme" format=3]

